Package: stabplot
Type: Package
Title: Stability Plots for Lasso Stability Selection
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Mahdi", "Nouraie", email = "mahdinouraie20@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Samuel", "Muller", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides stability selection with Lasso and two diagnostic plots for assessing selection stability. The Regustab plot shows stability across the regularisation parameter grid, while the Convstab plot shows stability as a function of the number of subsamples.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: glmnet, latex2exp, ggplot2
Encoding: UTF-8
